{"unit_id":"HongzhongL__dsh-hotswap#card-zh","repo":"HongzhongL/dsh-hotswap","commit":"86b17d39f36979aeb80e745349ebeeeca5ff6e0a","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-hotswap 是面向 DSH Web 的 Cordis 插件管理器，在设置页提供插件管理标签。它通过 Web 路由和 Loader 条目 API 在运行时启用、停用或重启插件，并把开关状态写入 profile 补丁文件。它还可监视 profile 的 package.json，同步热挂载和卸载 bundle；界面支持搜索、状态筛选和恢复管理器停用的插件。适合需要在 Web 会话中管理插件而不重启 DSH 的用户。需要 DSH Web profile；没有额外 API 密钥配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:746-789","client.js:514-530","index.js:682-725"]}
{"unit_id":"HongzhongL__dsh-hotswap#card-en","repo":"HongzhongL/dsh-hotswap","commit":"86b17d39f36979aeb80e745349ebeeeca5ff6e0a","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-hotswap manages Cordis plugins in DSH Web. Its Settings tab lists plugins and enables, disables, or restarts them at runtime. It saves toggle state in the profile patch file and syncs bundle changes from profile package.json. Manage plugins without restarting DSH; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:746-789","client.js:514-530","index.js:682-725"]}
